# Space Fractions example configuration.
# Requirement coverage: [ASR-2] (admin token configuration)
# Copy to your shell environment (or a process manager config). Values shown are
# variable names only; do NOT commit real secrets here.

# Port the HTTP server listens on.
PORT=3000

# Bearer token required by the admin question-management API.
# Set a strong value before exposing the service outside a local machine.
ADMIN_TOKEN=
